flowchart TD
    Headers[Source headers] --> HeaderRules[table_column_rules/**/*.json]
    HeaderRules --> Canonical[Resolve canonical headers]
    Rows[Table rows] --> Label[Build label:value text]
    Canonical --> Label
    Label --> CompositeName{First + last name metadata?}
    CompositeName -->|yes| AddFullName[Append full name: First Last]
    CompositeName -->|no| NoFullName[No composite name added]
    AddFullName --> Regex[Regex scanner]
    NoFullName --> Regex
